><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250702093838+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250702093840+10'00'" name="e4013843-b278-435c-9bb6-320f173d8af0" page="9" coords="36.000000,527.633000,298.984000,527.633000,36.000000,516.603000,298.984000,516.603000,36.000000,516.635000,298.950000,516.635000,36.000000,505.605000,298.950000,505.605000,36.000000,505.637000,299.002000,505.637000,36.000000,494.607000,299.002000,494.607000,36.000000,494.639000,299.001000,494.639000,36.000000,483.609000,299.001000,483.609000,36.000000,483.641000,299.004000,483.641000,36.000000,472.611000,299.004000,472.611000,255.856000,481.771000,260.226000,481.771000,255.856000,473.241000,260.226000,473.241000,36.000000,472.643000,298.997000,472.643000,36.000000,461.613000,298.997000,461.613000,36.000000,461.645000,298.948000,461.645000,36.000000,450.615000,298.948000,450.615000,169.512000,459.775000,173.882000,459.775000,169.512000,451.245000,173.882000,451.245000,35.999000,450.647000,99.807800,450.647000,35.999000,439.617000,99.807800,439.617000" rect="35.654300,439.272000,299.348000,527.978000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>The LEAF-Q can be used to determine females at low risk of LEArelated&#xD;conditions given the high negative predictive values identified&#xD;in this study. The subscale scores identified the presence of&#xD;bone and menstrual impairments in this multisport sample. The&#xD;overall score was generally unable to classify athletes as “high risk”&#xD;due to the low specificity, and as such, caution is required in&#xD;interpreting these results beyond “not low risk” to avoid negative&#xD;labeling effects.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="9" rect="612.000000,435.633000,796.000000,527.633000"
/></highlight
